---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant ControlDB as Control DB
    participant ExecutionDB as Execution DBs

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo run export
    activate Vigilo

    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Validate export request
    Vigilo->>ControlDB: Load run
    ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Run record
    Vigilo->>ControlDB: Resolve readable execution routes
    ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Run-shard database aliases
    Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Load published summaries in one batch per database
    ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Settlement counts, missing/unresolved counts, and retained scores
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Merge routed summaries in shard order

    alt JSON export
        loop Routed shard batches
            Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Load executions and related records
            ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Batch data
            Vigilo->>Vigilo: Accumulate export data
        end
        Vigilo->>Vigilo: Build export payload with evidence authority labels
        Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    else JSONL export
        Vigilo-->>User: Run line
        Vigilo-->>User: Summary line
        loop Routed shard batches
            Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Load executions and related records
            ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Batch data
            Vigilo-->>User: Execution, aggregate, attempt, result, and diagnostic lines with authority labels
        end
        Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    else Validation or lookup fails
        Vigilo-->>User: Export error
    end

    deactivate Vigilo
